<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-11-17T05:09:33.978Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:09:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb attacks continued in Damascus suburbs, with a car bomb killing a child and another person in Jaramana and an explosion killing a father and his child near the capital, while separate car bomb blasts killed two people, including a child, in the capital area. Israeli troops remain active in Syria, creating tension and the risk of new enemies, and the window for an Israeli-Syrian peace deal is closing. Jordan sentenced three people to death for a Greek Orthodox church attack. The UN noted that progress in Syria is real but fragile, and OCHA warned Syrians cannot afford more instability. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBvT3RzejQ4RW9UZzN0N3BDeWZGU203VVR3QlExVUxDWjVrMXN5a3hUeGdsRW11VzA1TndMM1lOb0Y2SDYwWnh2UHYtaE9EWjVhUkJqcnJiWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQM1dHMVdKTGxYRUFxYURFelNiTWlEdXcxMG9vb25BT29hNjhOaG9XSV92TVpxb2V2bGpwT1BvZTNiUjF1dDlIUzNkek80anFYTmF3TnY1WHR1bXpwRExUMXoySGpObXIwSEJ3ZTJCakhBY1dEajhRamRXMDdCbVhMSjlLTEcwSVdVeWk2TlI0ZlRKb2M2WTV1cVNjRjJWbF9paDBmZEswSk1vYVZEQzJ6RHN3?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPZ1BkLWlMbDFENjRVUFF4MHpNa0JXTEdmSVN6Zkh5LXUzREFPNktienNqRmRJRTFQWTRuY1ozVnpuUzhJRG5MY0FMQXRjV1IyNmJCdzJfalFYS1JEalRVTS1hYjg4STJUdldQZVBhOHpRWjNzeXIxS2IyYWM0bjVORkI5QUJJOXJGcWhJMUNUblJ2cmNxX3hz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.